and compare that number to the general populace. There is at  
least the same proportion of people in this country who have
rescinded all their contracts with the State, and enjoy the
status of sovereign over government. The number is growing all
the time, as more people discover the facts.

In a nutshell: Look at your contracts with the government. Decide
if you were made aware of all the terms and conditions of those
contracts, or if you were entered into them as a minor, by your
parents or guardians, without your consent. Write up affidavits
declaring the contracts unlawful due to fraud, and rescind them.
Have three witnesses for each affidavit, one affidavit for each
contract (driver's license, marriage license, social security,
etc). Send copies of each affidavit to the appropriate agencies.
Get rid of your toys. Judgment proof yourself (Duncan Frissell
has had many excellent things to say on this subject).

Now start living your life. You may never even hear anything from
the State. If they come knocking on your door and want to ask you
questions, the proper response is, "Put them in writing!" If they
attempt to bring legal charges against you, defend yourself against
them with all the fervor you would defend your life with against
any common thug.

